OL,5,
OL,6,FA "controlling" and "narcissistic" man
OL,7,Ftried to visit two sex workers shortly
OL,8,Fafter raping and murdering his
OL,9,Fgirlfriend, a jury has heard.
OL,11,FStephen Sexton, 39, is accused of
OL,12,Fkilling Joanna Derkacz at her home in
OL,13,FWaterlooville, Hampshire, in December
OL,14,F2023.
OL,16,FSexton, of Cherrywood Gardens, in
OL,17,FTotton, Hampshire, is on trial at
OL,18,FWinchester Crown Court.
